12970/extras/9b87de23f96ef96e60e84dbca40974b6.poster.avif?t=1744931969\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/9b87de23f96ef96e60e84dbca40974b6.webm?t=1744931969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/9b87de23f96ef96e60e84dbca40974b6.mp4?t=1744931969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>    <br>Each level has its own routes, but by exploring, experimenting, and making the most of your gauntlet, you\u2019ll be able to create your own shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/3e25f8765397ac8c1d6eba9e473f92d1.poster.avif?t=1744931969\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/3e25f8765397ac8c1d6eba9e473f92d1.webm?t=1744931969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/3e25f8765397ac8c1d6eba9e473f92d1.mp4?t=1744931969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/3577f9ccee489ddcea8e27adbceb202c.poster.avif?t=1744931969\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/3577f9ccee489ddcea8e27adbceb202c.webm?t=1744931969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/3577f9ccee489ddcea8e27adbceb202c.mp4?t=1744931969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Players who break records in each zone will earn extra rewards that unlock exclusive secrets.</p>",
